{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/192421-1-thing-infrastructures","id":192421,"title":"1 Thing Infrastructures","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-09T08:22:14-07:00","id":192421,"title":"1 Thing Infrastructures","content":"Some of the examples in the book of Infrastructures seem more like outputs (e.g., Angel as an Elimination Infrastructure). Am I misunderstanding this? If I'm not, how is this an infrastructure (e.g., how would you suborn it, where is the linchpin)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T14:31:41-07:00","id":192761,"title":"","content":"The Output of one piece of Infrastructure is often another piece of Infrastructure itself or something meant to support or build new Infrastructure. The definitions of the various Infrastructure vocabulary (project, output, occult matrix, and infrastructure) are fairly fluid. The electricity metaphor is probably the best I can come up with:<br /> <br /> You build a power station (coal, hydro, nuclear, whatever) to generate electricity. The process of building that power station requires all sorts of material and manpower, but the whole process from laying the foundation to turning on the turbines is a project. The Output of that project is a bunch of electricity.<br /> <br /> Electricity is cool and all, but we produce the stuff because of the nifty things we can do with it. But how do we get it from the power station to where we need it to be? Power lines. This is our Logistical Infrastructure - carrying a resource (the electricity) from one place to another. The Output in this case isn't the electricity itself but rather the *transporting* of that electricity to where it is needed.<br /> <br /> Once we get the power to the electric socket, the electricity doesn't just magically power on the box fan (or whatever). Someone has to plug that fan in. The electric socket is part of the Infrastructure, but so is the dude with the job of plugging in the fan.<br /> <br /> What's the occult matrix? Depends on how far you want to stretch things, I'd say. You could argue that the fan that is plugged into the powered electric socket is the occult matrix, but you could also extend it and say that everything from the power station to the fan is a part of the necessary configuration required to generate the desired final Ouput (a running fan). There are also a bunch of little occult matrices along the way - the fan itself (which is made up of an elaborate configuration of moving and non-moving parts) or even the power station (which is a configuration of materials and manpower connected to a source of energy).<br /> <br /> Does that make a bit more sense?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T08:03:03-07:00","id":197933,"title":"","content":"The thing that confused me is that the book refers to things like a Defense Infrastructure as a Hunter Angel, which is weird, a Hunter Angel is not a grouping of materials and processes. However, in &quot;How an Angel Dies,&quot; the Lambent is the OUTPUT of an Occult Matrix generated by the bridge infrastructure, so really the bridge infrastructure is the Defense Infrastructure, that generates the Lambent, who actually does the &quot;defensing&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T09:03:00-07:00","id":197963,"title":"","content":"The way I've seen it is that a truly powerful Output is never simply the product of four pieces of Infrastructure and *poof* you have a Rank 7 Angel; They're the Output of a grand total of about 12-15 intermediate Occult Matrices, the Output of each is the Infrastructure of the next. (All numbers are arbitrary.)<br /> <br /> Here's an example.<ul><li>In one step, a gold foundry builds a plant to a dying town and revitalizes it.</li> <li>The plant has an accident that dumps a byproduct into the river.</li> <li>The byproduct is taken up by the wildlife, creating a super-predator that decimates the fishing industry.</li> <li>The decimation of the fishing industry turns the local fisherman to the drastic measures of sacrificing to an Angel that is stored under the island off of the coast, reviving it.</li> <li>The Angel then empowers the locals with supernatural abilities, who dominate the social landscape through murder, mind-control, and forced marriages.</li> <li>An outsider is sacrificed to the Angel to empower an effect that gets the attention of the psychics of the neighboring towns.</li> <li>An investigator is sent to find the outsider, who uncovers not only the ritual sacrifices but also the supernatural corruption of the town.</li> <li>The army and Treasury department is called in, the followers of the Angels are shown to the President as evidence of the need of a supernatural-focused joint task force.</li> </ul><ul><li>The Output of these steps is the creation of the Elimination Infrastructure known as Delta Green. Each step creates the situation and material used for the next Matrix.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> That's one possible &quot;Matrix-Chain&quot;, and as you can see, entire campaigns can be a fraction of the chain, completely without the PCs awareness.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I know I mangled the actual backstory of Innsmouth/Delta Green, but it's just an example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T09:58:34-07:00","id":198014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PencilBoy99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/192421-1-thing-infrastructures?p=197933#post197933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing that confused me is that the book refers to things like a Defense Infrastructure as a Hunter Angel, which is weird, a Hunter Angel is not a grouping of materials and processes.</div> </div> </div> </div> An Angel of the God-Machine is absolutely a grouping of materials and processes. Heck, a human being is a grouping of materials and processes. Sentient things are used as Infrastructure all the time. Infrastructure is essentially just the tools the God-Machine uses to lay the groundwork for its Occult Matrices, and Angels are pretty much exactly that. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> However, in &amp;quot;How an Angel Dies,&amp;quot; the Lambent is the OUTPUT of an Occult Matrix generated by the bridge infrastructure, so really the bridge infrastructure is the Defense Infrastructure, that generates the Lambent, who actually does the &amp;quot;defensing&amp;quot; </div> </div> </div> The output of an Occult Matrix can be, and almost always is, Infrastructure. Output and Infrastructure are not mutually exclusive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}